 The NOTICE file at the top of the source is Rockchip's, and parts of the
 tree carry Apache-2.0 headers while others carry no licence text at all.
 Several components are shipped as prebuilt objects with no source:
 libsmartIr, libIspFec's precompiled halves, and the per-sensor AIISP
 libraries under rkaiq/algos/aiisp. On Debian systems the full text of the
 Apache License 2.0 is in /usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0.

